{"title":"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Kim earned scores of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/5/005c918553d9a0acdb15daf6c96c34dcbf742975.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$87,83, and 88$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" /> on her first three mathematics examinations. If Kim receives a score of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> on the fourth exam, then her average will \n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbda5197c0723ed126bcd8df7451f2c14b5af1b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ \\text{remain the same} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ \\text{increase by 1} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ \\text{increase by 2} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ \\text{increase by 3} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ \\text{increase by 4} }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"794\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The average of the first three test scores is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/2/79272d6d81c9fda764830d716b3565f6ba569ec0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{88+83+87}{3}=86$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"144\" height=\"37\" />. The average of all four exams is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/2/582e7a1bf3214edcde9a7a5a934a1e19445bd59a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{87+83+88+90}{4}=87$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"185\" height=\"38\" />. It increased by one point. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/5/fd5cf5dbc8229738cf06adbf2aa73fd75994b058.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME\" title=\"1995 AHSME\">1995 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Proble